00:30.65,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,雨｜あ#｜め上｜!あがりの空｜そ#｜らを仰｜あ#｜おぐ度｜た#｜びComment: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:30.65,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Every time I look up to the sky after the rainComment: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.16,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nakimushi datta koro no boku wo omouComment: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.16,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,泣｜なき虫｜む#｜しだった頃｜こ#｜ろの僕｜ぼ#｜くを思｜お#｜もうComment: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.16,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I think back to when I was a crybabyComment: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:43.90,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dareka no senaka wo gamushara ni oikaketaComment: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:43.90,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰｜だ#｜れかの背｜せ中｜!な#｜かをがむしゃらに追｜おいかけたComment: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:43.90,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I was chasing somebody's back blindlyComment: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.88,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,"Tsuyoku naritai" tteComment: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.88,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,「強｜つ#｜よくなりたい」ってComment: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.88,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thinking "I want to be stronger"Comment: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:52.06,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Ima wa kaze ni kieta "arigatou"Comment: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:52.06,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,今｜い#｜まは風｜か#｜ぜに消｜きえた「ありがとう」Comment: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:52.06,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The word "thank you" has faded into the wind nowComment: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:57.24,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku wa tsuyoku nareteiru no kana?Comment: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:57.24,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くは強｜つ#｜よくなれているのかな?Comment: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:57.24,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Am I getting stronger?Comment: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:02.91,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kotae wa mada desou ni nai kara saComment: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:02.91,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,答｜こ#｜たえはまだ出｜でそうにないからさComment: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:02.91,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I don't know the answer yetComment: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:08.43,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yappari mada aruiteiku yoComment: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:08.43,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,やっぱりまだ歩｜あ#｜るいていくよComment: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:08.43,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That's why I'll keep walking aheadComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Saa yukouComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,さぁ行｜ゆこうComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tachidomaru koto nakuComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまることなくComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nagareru toki ni makenai youniComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,流｜な#｜がれる時｜と#｜きに負｜まけないようにComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nando mo tachimukai tsuzukeyouComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,何｜なん度｜!ども立｜たち向｜むかい続｜つ#｜づけようComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Taisetsu na mono ushinaitakunai karaComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜た#｜い切｜!せ#｜つなもの失｜<う#｜し#｜ないたくないからComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku no naka ni nagareru koe waComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くの中｜な#｜かに流｜な#｜がれる声｜こ#｜えはComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The voice inside of meComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zutto zutto boku wo sasaeteruComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ずっとずっと僕｜ぼ#｜くを支｜さ#｜さえてるComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,keeps sustaining meComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,ITAZURA na ame ga jama suru kedoComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イタズラな雨｜あ#｜めが邪｜じゃ魔｜!まするけどComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wicked rain will get in my wayComment: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:51.35,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nigedasanai karaComment: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:51.35,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,逃｜にげ出｜ださないからComment: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:51.35,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,But I won't walk awayComment: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:56.81,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Saa yukouComment: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:56.81,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,さぁ行｜ゆこうComment: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:56.81,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:56.81,0:02:00.09,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tachidomaru koto nakuComment: 0,0:01:56.81,0:02:00.09,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまることなくComment: 0,0:01:56.81,0:02:00.09,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:05.38,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nagareru toki ni makenai youniComment: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:05.38,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,流｜な#｜がれる時｜と#｜きに負｜まけないようにComment: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:05.38,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:11.02,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nando mo tachimukai tsuzukeyouComment: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:11.02,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,何｜なん度｜!ども立｜たち向｜むかい続｜つ#｜づけようComment: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:11.02,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:16.38,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Taisetsu na mono ushinaitakunai karaComment: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:16.38,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜た#｜い切｜!せ#｜つなもの失｜<う#｜し#｜ないたくないからComment: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:16.38,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:22.08,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shinjita sono saki he to...Comment: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:22.08,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,信｜し#｜んじたその先｜さ#｜きへと...Comment: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:22.08,OP13-Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,To the future I believe in...Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.68,0:00:2