7.62,0:02:19.02,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.02,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,たDialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.35,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,soDialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.35,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,そDialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:19.81,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:19.81,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,のDialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.06,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,saDialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.06,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,先Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.06,OP13-Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,さDialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.45,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.45,OP13-Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,きDialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.76,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.76,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,へDialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.11,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,to...Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.11,OP13-Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,と...Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a tunnel of fire in the smoke!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You've always been like this!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:48.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You've never listened to me...Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and you've always done crazy things like this!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,F-Fire Fist Ace is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,now free!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Great! You did it, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:51.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He rescued Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:57.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He has been relentless since Impel Down! That guy is really...Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Something else!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your cool! Be ready to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot them when they land!Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:14.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay alert, Luffy! Let's split up for now!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.31,0:04:23.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Flame Commandment!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Pillar!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.03,Main,,0,0,0,,He's strong! Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you fight, Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-san! Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember! Fire Fist Ace is fire- he's a Logia!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:08.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought that you'd be the one saving me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:16.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Old guy Whitebeard and the others helped me out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you're safe now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Your execution will take place here now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you to pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.01,0:05:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my brother! Leave him alone!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,They make a good team.Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Clear the way so they can get away!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Firefly!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiery Doll!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Execute Fire Fist and Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotten stronger, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be stronger than you someday!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll protect you for now.Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice Block!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand aside, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Pheasant Beak!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror Flame!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this blunder! Even I couldn't stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Let them go! That way, things will be more interesting!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:00.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Even an admiral's power is useless against them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.80,Main,,0,0,0,,How can we fight them?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your head!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let them get away from here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:20.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2...Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:24.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I hardly granted your wish.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And now, I need to hurry and escape...Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,To whom does this traitor owe allegiance?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.85,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he's a prisoner impersonating a guard!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:46.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Heads up, everyone! Their ship is moving!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:49.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get close! It's running on the ground with its paddles!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:52.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's controlling it?Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:56.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Squard!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whirl Spider Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:05.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops, everyone, run!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:08.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave the war to us!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:16.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Those fools!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid, Squard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you have a death wish!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What I did to Pops was horrible.Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if this doesn't make amends for it,Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't let things go like this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys. I shouldn't have let you come with me.Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Captain! Don't worry!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:07.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We followed you because we wanted to!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:10.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll choose where to die on our own!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:13.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! We'll follow you to the end!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody, take Ace and run!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,St. Elmo's Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Fool!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn Squard! That's not the smart way to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:40.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hurry up and get these cuffs off me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The ship stopped moving!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:15.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand how ungrateful it is for a child...Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:20.66,Main,,0,0,0,,to die before his parent, Squard?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get too confident!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The stab wound you gave me isn't going to kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody grows old and dies eventually!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We accomplished our goal here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need for us to keep fighting here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you all my final order as your captain!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,"Final order"?! Wait a second, Pops! That sounds sad!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the New World together!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Cross Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:26.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It is time for us to part ways!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, survive at any cost and return to the New World safely!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.98,0:12:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Pops! Are you planning to die here?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:52.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a relic of a bygone era!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.78,0:12:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no ship that can carry me into the new age!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Escape from here, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:16.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.35,0:13:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He gave us an order! We need to go!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Old guy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:40.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:44.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, why do you look so out of spirits?Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Join us! There's more than enough treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:53.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Never mind that guy. He's not interested in treasures.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:57.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's odd! What kind of pirate is he?Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:14:00.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What is it that you want?Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Newgate!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:09.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been traveling a very long time.Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get it over with!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Marineford is in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.04,Captions,,0,0,300,,Absolute JusticeDialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He's willing to destroy the whole island!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna leave you! You gotta come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:40.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to disobey your captain's orders?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Escape from here, you brats!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Now is our chance! Kill Whitebeard! He's dying already!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Let's do as Pops said!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:15:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't mind leaving Pops behind?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:07.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Stupid! No one wants to leave him behind!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Grumbling about it at a time like this...Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,is the same as trampling on Pops' determination!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get ready to sail out!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna leave soon! Hurry up and board the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Marco, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Since he isn't concerned about Fire Fist Ace anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's clear that his intention is to sink Marineford into the ocean.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Along with himself!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp! You're all right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He wants to bring this era to a close? I guess the time is right.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Whitebeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Are the allies he sold out all dead now?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What is happening at Marineford right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The Transponder Snail isn't coming out?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! Captain Buggy is about to defeat Whitebeard! There's no time for this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.22,0:16:49.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't say it like it's an easy thing to do!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:53.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He may be dying, but he's still super strong! Have they been paying attention?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:59.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why did I tell them I was going to defeat that man?! I really messed up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:02.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! It's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! We gotta broadcast Captain Buggy's big moment all over the world!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Get it out at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Come out now!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Or we're gonna burn you out of it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The Transponder Snail came out on its own!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, capture my bravery!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:25.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The video is back!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:28.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, well...Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Transponder Snail, go lower!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:38.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone! I'm Buggy and I'm a legend!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You again?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Get to the sea now!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:49.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We survivors need to return to the New World safely!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:52.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away! Kill as many as you can!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one that you ought to worry about!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:06.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He's badly injured, but he should be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Our Captain gave us an order! Come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Blenheim! You gotta carry Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy! Why are you standing around?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, let's go! The old man has made up his mind...Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:31.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! And it won't be in vain!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Back off, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:25.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't need words now.Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Just tell me one thing, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Were you happy to have me as your father?Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You still tryin' to stand up?Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:56.77,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to see you die here, kid.Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:20:03.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you still want to fight, then take my name and roam the seas wild and free!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:06.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Become my son!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Run to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-san, Luffy-kun, get in front of me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:43.91,Main,,0,0,0,,They want to get you two!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But Pops wants there to be as many survivors as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We've stolen a Navy ship! Get on board quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Do they really think that they can get away?! What a simple bunch.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, move aside a little bit!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You two, just keep going until you reach the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as you rescue Fire Fist Ace, you run!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:33.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates must be a group of cowards!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.57,0:21:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:37.27,Main,,0,0,0,,He's obviously trying to stir us up!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If you stop, you'll just be playing into his hands!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, considering who your captain is, it's no surprise to me.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:50.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Because after all, Whitebeard is just a...Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,loser from a bygone era!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,A loser?Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Take back what you just said!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't, Ace! Don't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,He can say whatever he wants!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He's mocking Pops.Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:16.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you ask me to take it back?Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll never happen! And here's why.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:28.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Your real father, Gold Roger, conquered the Grand Line...Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:35.20,Main,,0,0,0,,and opened the door to the Great Pirate Era.Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.15,0:22:38.72,Main,,0,0,0,,As a Navy admiral, I shouldn't be the one to say this...Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:42.51,Main,,0,0,0,,but he was true to his name: the King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:46.91,Main,,0,0,0,,In comparison, what has Whitebeard done?Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he really had the intention to fight...Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.21,0:22:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I assume that he established a large family somewhere...Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.79,Main,,0,0,0,,and was satisfied with being a big fish in a little barrel.Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,There are some fools in this world...Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,who say that he was able to keep the peace on various islands...Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,but in my opinion, all he did was make weak pirates live in fear of him...Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,and he thinks that it made him a hero! What a joke!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,When Roger was around, Whitebeard was always second in billing...Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,and even after he died, Whitebeard could never become the King.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He was never able to surpass Roger... and that makes him a loser in life!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,That is the truth about Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:39.64,Main,,0,0,0,,When you think about it, his existence was sad. He gathered a bunch of punks who called him Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and roamed the seas with his fake family.Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.67,0:23:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,And although he reigned the sea for decades...Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.71,0:23:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,he couldn't become the King, and gained nothingDialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:55.81,Main,,0,0,0,,and at the end, he was stabbed by a fool, one of his sons who fell for my trick...Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.81,0:23:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,and now he will die to protect that son.Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that he lived a worthless life?Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.09,0:24:04.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Ace, come back!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops gave us a home!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll never understand his greatness!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,People don't deserve to live if they can't live justly!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:24.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Punks like you guys don't deserve a place to live!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.07,0:24:25.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:31.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard will die as a loser! It's fitting for a big fish in a little barrel!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.15,0:24:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is a great pirate who shaped this era!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.39,0:24:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of the man who saved me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.19,0:24:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.16,0:24:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The name of this era is "Whitebeard!"Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Both Whitebeard and those who called him Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.21,0:25:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,are just losers!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.12,0:25:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace was burned!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.99,0:25:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you being careless because you ate...Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.74,0:25:22.18,Main,,0,0,0,,a Logia type Devil Fruit, the most powerful type?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.18,0:25:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're just fire. My magma can burn even you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.48,0:25:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,My powers are far superior to yours!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.74,0:25:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.08,0:25:39.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy-kun, you shouldn't fight anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.92,0:25:44.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's Vivre Card!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.12,0:25:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger the Pirate King and Dragon the Revolutionary!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to hear that the sons of those two were blood-brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're both criminals by blood!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.71,0:26:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if the others get away as long as I get you two!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch what I do.Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.01,0:26:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.59,0:26:15.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!